            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Devour Flesh"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe ghul attempts to eat a portion of the grabbed creature's flesh. It makes a jaws Strike against the grabbed creature. On a success, the ghul successfully devours some of the flesh and regains 3d6 Hit Points. The grabbed creature becomes drained 1 (or drained 2 if the jaws Strike was a critical success). The violent consumption requires the ghul to release the creature as it feasts.\n\nA ghul can regain Hit Points from consuming the flesh of a given creature only once per hour; it must consume the flesh of a different creature to gain additional Hit Points during this time."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "f8fef251-5e3f-42f7-9cb5-244eabe3eb2a",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:28.527612"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Luring Laugh"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(enchantment, incapacitation, mental, primal)\n\nThe ghul lets out an alluring chitter. Each creature in a 60-foot emanation must succeed at a DC 19 Will save or become fascinated, flat-footed, and compelled to move toward the ghul on the creature's turn. The effect lasts until the end of the ghul's next turn, but the ghul can Sustain a Spell on Luring Laugh. If the ghul attacks, the fascinated condition ends for only the creature that's attacked. On a successful save, a creature is temporarily immune to Luring Laugh for 24 hours."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
